  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_4735e186f6ea441e98bc07d2e2030b6d",
      "statement": "Roster persistence is dual-layered with localStorage as the authoritative store and the API as a best-effort mirror: apps/web/src/lib/api.ts writes the key forceorg_rosters_<userId> on every read and write, and every /api/rosters call is wrapped in a swallow-everything catch, so the UI stays fully functional with the API offline, misconfigured, or rejecting the token.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/src/lib/api.ts#L133-L150",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:dc512ada19962b3467c4127f50fb22ebeccdb69d3a62dcb47628e042fe5df210:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/src/lib/api.ts#L243-L386",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:81678d970bbf975ef6b19099691a08f0e117382de68fb46d5eb003871ef08965:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d8d10ed9d06a49d5ad62c89af5098bf5",
      "statement": "The guest path performs no server writes at all: with no Supabase session getAuthToken() collapses any failure into null, apiFetch omits the Authorization header, requireAuth answers 401 UNAUTHORIZED, the wrapper's catch swallows the ApiError, and all roster state changes land only in localStorage.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/api/src/middleware/auth.ts#L19-L49",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c654293f6d94c4f8e1404a254611bf3239dc953d343d000b15b5330048ab574c:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/src/lib/api.ts#L31-L72",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2a278177367588d80f73bb54f180c19b79c7c513192bdd383f55c20553909a36:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a2bf469c2ec94714b6af70c43954f97f",
      "statement": "The bearer token the web client sends is the Supabase access_token, signed by the Supabase project's secret rather than the instance's JWT_SECRET, so jwt.verify rejects it with 401 TOKEN_INVALID and the authenticated path degrades to the same local-persistence branch; apps/api exposes no endpoint that mints a compatible token.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/api/src/index.ts#L56-L60",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:890b374d7b661ccfe8b268e9a207524dd0407a6cc5daaf8301469feead5d4fbe:"
