    {
      "id": "claim_ed183000fcc74b5f9de1a9d8a1ae9769",
      "statement": "Offline-created roster ids (army_<timestamp>_<rand>) are not UUIDs while UserArmy.id is declared @db.Uuid, so a later PUT or DELETE /rosters/:id fails UUID validation before any ownership lookup can return 404, the route catch converts it to 500 DB_ERROR, and the client swallows it silently.",
