    {
      "id": "claim_8141d04a8d984d148ba9e9f2d4473f49",
      "statement": "Only the Playwright guest suite in apps/web/e2e/critical-flows.spec.ts covers this flow end to end, and its beforeEach guest login is satisfied entirely client-side; apps/api has no tests and its lint script is only tsc --noEmit, so nothing asserts that a roster actually reaches Postgres.",
